### ============================================
### OAuth2 Password Bearer - Security
### ============================================

### 1. Successful request - valid Bearer token (expect 200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/
Authorization: Bearer fake-super-secret-token

###

### 2. Missing Authorization header (expect 401)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/

###

### 3. Invalid Bearer token format (expect 401)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/items/
Authorization: Basic fake-super-secret-token